  "gaps_note": "Authored from AWS product knowledge, not a console capture (this run's private captures checkout did not run). Scoped to the sections core/ssm_core.py backs with real, stateful operations: Parameter Store, Documents, Run Command, State Manager (associations), Maintenance Windows, Patch Manager (baselines). Sections that need a real SSM Agent / managed-instance fleet Vyomi doesn't have (Fleet Manager, Session Manager, Inventory, Hybrid Activations, Distributor, Automation execution, Change Manager, Change Calendar, OpsCenter, Explorer, Application Manager, AppConfig, Compliance, Quick Setup) are left out of nav and pages entirely rather than declared honest_page, since they were never captured and are not in consoles/honest-allowlist.json.",
